{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1011159-benefits-of-a-solar-circle-bond","id":1011159,"title":"Benefits of a Solar Circle Bond","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-02T12:09:20-08:00","id":1011159,"title":"Benefits of a Solar Circle Bond","content":"I am working from the idea that the players circle has sworn powerful oaths backed by Solar Sorcery that bonded them into a group. This effects the group still but I have not decided on an exact in game affect. Any suggestions?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12422-zylosan","name":"zylosan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-02T12:13:25-08:00","id":1011163,"title":"","content":"Maybe they have an intimacy of loyalty that can't be eroded? Though that might be a bit powerful... perhaps it can be eroded, but it's difficult, or it automatically restores itself by one level every day, or something like that?<br /> (Though, honestly, you may not care that the PCs can't be convinced by NPCs to betray each other)<br /> <br /> Maybe also some kind of cooperation bonus as well? Like, they get a few extra dice (that count as charm dice) when taking actions that directly benefit their fellows? Or they get some kind of bonus to Defend Other with the rest of the circle?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-02T12:44:45-08:00","id":1011172,"title":"","content":"Not so mechanically sketchy or broken skills:<ul><li>Perfect direction sense to all members of the group.</li> <li>Empathy with members of the group (as in literally being able to glean their emotions).</li> <li>So long as a positive intimacy towards a group member is maintained, treat that intimacy as Defining.</li> </ul>Considerably more mechanically sketchy or broken skills:<ul><li>Able to &quot;borrow&quot; ability points that are higher than yours from allies that have different skills</li> <li>Actual telepathy with group members</li> <li>Communal pool of motes that members can pull from</li> </ul>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-02T14:12:28-08:00","id":1011215,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar368_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"368\" data-vbnamecard=\"368\">The Unsung Hero</a> <br /> <br /> The two ideas I have been given and discarded where the ability to share motes or willpower between members.<br /> <br /> As far as intimacies goes, how useful would the ability to always know the intensity and specifics of an intimacy towards or involving other members<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12422-zylosan","name":"zylosan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-02T15:47:54-08:00","id":1011255,"title":"","content":"How useful would it be to know how the people you have such a strong bond to actually feel?<br /> <br /> It is that useful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-02T16:11:36-08:00","id":1011264,"title":"","content":"Anyone have the sworn brotherhood oath spell on hand? Take those effects and beef them up considerably and boom.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T04:34:36-08:00","id":1011453,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1011159-benefits-of-a-solar-circle-bond?p=1011264#post1011264\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone have the sworn brotherhood oath spell on hand? Take those effects and beef them up considerably and boom.</div> </div> </div> </div>I admit I feel like that sort of scalar view of it feels iffy. I'd expect a Solar circle spell that defines a bond of unity to be something beyond &quot;a TCS++ effect&quot;. Or to put it another way, Oath of the Sworn Brotherhood shouldn't be the &quot;crappy version of the Oath type spell that non-Solars have to settle for&quot;; a Solar circle bonding effect is like creating a truly eternal bond, perhaps no more directly powerful, but one that the participants will share in a sense of kinship and unity even after a dozen reincarnations, rather than &quot;a mechanically more advantageous bond than OotSB because Solar sorcery yo&quot;.<br /> <br /> For one thing, &quot;Oath of the Totes Better Solar Brothers&quot; basically renders the TCS oath spell an XP sink or waste if you're a Solar able to eventually access OotTBSB.<br /> <br /> The Unsung Hero's ideas are pretty good for a general sort of oath of brotherhood effect, sensing changes in your brothers, knowing their state of being and such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":756,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/756-meianno-yuurei","user":"Meianno Yuurei","date":". 12-03-2016, 07:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/756-meianno-yuurei","name":"Meianno Yuurei","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar756_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-03T06:16:51-08:00","id":1011470,"title":"","content":"If it were me, id have such a spell be a plot device rather than something to give a player. I mean, sure, they could learn it, but the super limited use itd see makes it a bit of a waste.<br /> <br /> Personally, id have it have two effects. First, any member of the Brotherhood may activate any of their Charms for any willing member as if it were a personal use. Second, they may never be supernaturally coerced into betraying an intimacy towards another member.<br /> <br /> Id have one downside as well. Should a member ever develop a negative intimacy towards a Brother, then the Oath is broken for that member. The Solar Brotherhood requires utmost faith and trust in the Bond, and though powerful against outside forces, but internal conflict shatters it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/697-arteliex","name":"Arteliex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar697_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"591"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}